"The 状态 of this 意向声明. - '草稿' means that the 意向声明 still needs to be confirmed "
"before being usable. - '启用' means that the 意向声明 is usable. - 'Terminated' "
"designates that the 意向声明 has been marked as not to use anymore without "
"invalidating usages of it. - 'Revoked' means the 意向声明 should not have been "
"used. You will probably need to revert previous usages of it, if any.\n"

